      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IRINKA FRED (2) has a strong record here with eight wins and five placings from 17 starts. Hit the frame latest (18.28) when third at this track in a Grade 5. Looks suited here and rates on top. MAKO MERV (7) was quickly into stride and found the front last start to record an all-the-way win (18.19) at this track in a NG over 318m. Boasts a strong record from this draw with two wins and two minor placings from five starts. Hard to fault his recent form and can win again. NATES FURY (1) box seated before sticking on well to finish one length away in second (18.27) at this track in a Grade 5 over 318m. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Hard to beat again. COCO DAVIES (6) was in the money last start and wasn't beaten far - poses a threat again.",
